### PACE – Project Requests HTTP tests (create request + technical features + service selection)
# Run `cds watch` first. RequestFeatures / RequestServices are compositions of ProjectRequest,
# so they are created/updated/deleted through the parent (deep payloads) or via navigation.
#
# Order: run "Pick a service and plan" -> copy a service ID and one of its plan IDs into the
# "services" entries of "Create a full draft request" -> run it.

@host = http://localhost:4004
@catalog = {{host}}/odata/v4/catalog

### Pick a service and plan to reference in the request (grab the IDs from here)
GET {{catalog}}/Services?$select=ID,name,currency_code&$expand=plan($select=ID,name,imc)&$top=5

### Project Type dropdown list
GET {{catalog}}/ProjectTypes

### Market dropdown list
GET {{catalog}}/Markets

### List requests with children
GET {{catalog}}/ProjectRequest?$expand=features,services($expand=service($select=name),plan($select=name,imc))&$orderby=createdAt desc

### Create a full draft request (deep insert: details + features + selected services)
# @name createRequest
POST {{catalog}}/ProjectRequest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Retail Cloud Migration",
  "type_code": "AMS",
  "market_code": "APAC",
  "clientName": "ACME Retail",
  "projectPOC": "JDOE",
  "solutionArchPOC": "ASMITH",
  "status": "Draft",
  "features": [
    { "name": "Real-time data replication", "description": "S/4HANA to Cloud via events" },
    { "name": "API Management Gateway",     "description": "Expose OData services securely" }
  ],
  "services": [
    { "service_ID": "a3f1c2d4-0b5e-4a9c-8d21-1f6e7a0b9c11", "plan_ID": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555551", "noOfmetrics": 100, "currency_code": "USD" }
  ]
}
